                              "id": "E2leE",
                              "fill": "#111111",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "We present a systematic study of circuits, features, and attention head behaviors in GPT-2 and similar transformer architectures, providing evidence for composable computational structures.",
